WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.920
accompanied by photos of specific ICE agents

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:05.280
that they're targeting, one in particular,

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:09.160
who's a top person and a great person, a great patriot.

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:12.280
In July, approximately a dozen Antifa-aligned militants

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:14.320
stormed the ICE facility in Texas

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:17.120
and then lured officers out of the building

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:20.520
before firing dozens of rounds at police.

